  unitName: Time Mage Claris
  unitId: 30041
  unitNumber: 60
  description: A geomancer active from the ruined Vriksha Duchy. During the war with
    the gods she awakened the ability to manipulate time, allowing her to become
    known as a time mage. There are few records of time mages, and how she acquired
    the power is still being researched. One theory is that chronomancy is a natural
    power with great desctructive force, but there is nothing to prove this theory.
  summonDesc: I've been waiting for you.<br>I will show you time<br>moving towards
    justice.
  fusionDesc: Energy flows with time.<br>I can feel a great energy <br>flowing through
    me.
  evoDesc: Everyone has this ability.<br>My ability is just a bit stronger than most.
  element: 3
  rarity: 1
